# Broad catch-all for ALL mesh runtime state / config / secrets / audit logs — future-proof.
# Safe because no committed factory file uses the mesh- prefix (those are builtins-*.json,
# collectors-*.json, playbook-*.json). Keeps any new mesh-*.json/.log out of a public repo.
mesh-*.json
mesh-*.log
# macOS "keep both" duplicates of the ignored runtime data files (e.g. "alert-lifecycle 2.json")
alert-lifecycle*.json
